      {
        "id": 254,
        "title": "Réaction au feu",
        "date": "Parution du 21 avril 2026",
        "categories": [
          "erp",
          "igh",
          "hab",
          "ert"
        ],
        "image": null,
        "text": "<p align=\"justify\">R&Egrave;GLEMENT D&Eacute;L&Eacute;GU&Eacute; (UE) 2026/331 DE LA COMMISSION EUROP&Eacute;ENNE du 13&nbsp;f&eacute;vrier 2026 compl&eacute;tant le r&egrave;glement (UE) 2024/3110 du Parlement europ&eacute;en et du Conseil en d&eacute;terminant des classes de performance en ce qui concerne la caract&eacute;ristique essentielle &laquo;&nbsp;r&eacute;action au feu&nbsp;&raquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_txt/txt_erp_cdt_igh_hab/2026_331_reglement_eu.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Voir le texte</a></p>"
      },
      {
        "id": 249,
        "title": "Ascenseurs",
        "date": "Parution du 6 mars 2026",
        "categories": [
          "erp",
          "igh",
          "hab",
          "ert"
        ],
        "image": "https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/portail/images/index/CCH_AS02.jpg",
        "text": "<p align=\"justify\">D&eacute;cret n&deg;&nbsp;2026-166 du 4&nbsp;mars 2026 visant &agrave; garantir la s&eacute;curit&eacute; des ascenseurs face &agrave; l'arr&ecirc;t de certains r&eacute;seaux t&eacute;l&eacute;phoniques</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">Voir articles modifi&eacute;s&nbsp;: \r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr134_01a48.php?id=R134T6\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;134-6</a>,\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr134_01a48.php?id=R134T7\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;134-7</a> et \r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr134_01a48.php?id=R134T11\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;134-11</a></p>"
      },
      {
        "id": 248,
        "title": "Ascenseurs",
        "date": "Parution du 6 mars 2026",
        "categories": [
          "erp",
          "igh",
          "hab",
          "ert"
        ],
        "image": "https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/portail/images/index/CCH_AS02.jpg",
        "text": "<p align=\"justify\">Arr&ecirc;t&eacute; du 4&nbsp;mars 2026 modifiant les arr&ecirc;t&eacute;s du 7&nbsp;ao&ucirc;t 2012 relatif aux contr&ocirc;les techniques &agrave; r&eacute;aliser dans les installations d'ascenseurs et du 18&nbsp;novembre 2004 relatif &agrave; l'entretien des installations d'ascenseurs</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">Voir textes modifi&eacute;s&nbsp;: <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_txt/txt_as/a2004_11_18_23.php\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">Arr&ecirc;t&eacute; du 18&nbsp;novembre 2004</a> et \r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_txt/txt_as/a2012_08_07.php\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">Arr&ecirc;t&eacute; du 7&nbsp;ao&ucirc;t 2012</a></p>"
      },
      {
        "id": 240,
        "title": "",
        "date": "Parution du 20 novembre 2025",
        "categories": [
          "erp",
          "igh",
          "hab",
          "ert"
        ],
        "image": "https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/portail/images/index/JO.png",
        "text": "<p align=\"justify\"><b>D&eacute;cret n&deg;&nbsp;2025-1100 du 19&nbsp;novembre 2025</b> fixant les conditions de mise en oeuvre des solutions d'effet &eacute;quivalent li&eacute;es &agrave; la s&eacute;curit&eacute; contre l'incendie, transf&eacute;rant des dispositions r&eacute;glementaires concernant la s&eacute;curit&eacute; incendie des b&acirc;timents &agrave; usage professionnel (BUP) dans le code de la construction et de l'habitation et modifiant certaines proc&eacute;dures d'instruction</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><b>Suppression des demandes d'autorisation d'ouverture et de travaux des ERP de 5<sup>e</sup>&nbsp;cat&eacute;gorie sans locaux &agrave; sommeil au titre de la s&eacute;curit&eacute; incendie</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"justify\">-&nbsp;modification des articles <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr122_05a21.php?id=R122T5\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;122-5</a>, <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr122_05a21.php?id=R122T7\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;122-7</a>, <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr122_05a21.php?id=R122T11\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;122-11</a> <small>(applicable le 21/11/25)</small></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><b>Dispositions de s&eacute;curit&eacute; incendie communes &agrave; tous les b&acirc;timents et notamment les conditions de mise en &oelig;uvre des solutions d'effet &eacute;quivalent</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"justify\">-&nbsp;modification des articles <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr142_01a05.php?id=R142T1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;142-1</a>, <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr143_01a47.php?id=R143T34\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;143-34</a> <small>(applicable le 21/11/25)</small><br>\r\n-&nbsp;abrogation des articles <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr143_01a47.php?id=R143T35\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.*&nbsp;143-35</a>, <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr143_01a47.php?id=R143T36\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;143-36</a>, <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr146_01a35.php?id=R146T21\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.*&nbsp;146-21</a> et <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr146_01a35.php?id=R146T22\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;146-22</a> <small>(applicable le 21/11/25)</small><br>\r\n-&nbsp;remplacement des articles <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr141_01a13.php?id=top\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">D.&nbsp;141-1 &agrave; D.&nbsp;141-13</a> par les articles <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr141_01a17.php?id=top\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;141-1 &agrave; R.&nbsp;141-17</a> <small>(applicable le 01/07/26)</small> <br>-&nbsp;modification des articles <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr143_01a47.php?id=R143T44\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;143-44</a>, <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr146_01a35.php?id=R146T20\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;146-20</a>, <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr146_01a35.php?id=R146T26\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;146-26</a> et <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr146_01a35.php?id=R146T35\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;146-35</a> <small>(applicable le 01/07/26)</small></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><b>Transfert des dispositions du Code du travail concernant la s&eacute;curit&eacute; incendie pour la conception des b&acirc;timents &agrave; usage professionnel (BUP) dans le Code de la construction et de l'habitation</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"justify\">-&nbsp;modification de l'article <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr113_01.php?id=R113T1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;113-1</a> <small>(applicable le 21/11/25)</small><br>\r\n-&nbsp;cr&eacute;ation des articles <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cch/cchr144_01a20.php?id=top\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;144-1 &agrave; R.&nbsp;144-20</a> du Code de la construction et de l'habitation, <small>(applicable le 01/01/27)</small><br>\r\n-&nbsp;suppression des articles <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/portail/code/code-travail.php?id=cdt2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;4216-1 &agrave; R.&nbsp;4216-34</a> du code du travail <small>(applicable le 01/01/27)</small><br>\r\n-&nbsp;modification des articles <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cdt/r4211_03a05.php?id=R4211T3\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;4211-3</a>, <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cdt/r4214_01a08.php?id=R4214T7\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;4214-7</a>, <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cdt/r4214_09a17.php?id=R4214T9\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;4214-9</a>, <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cdt/r4214_26a28.php?id=R4214T28\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;4214-28, <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cdt/r4227_01a03.php?id=R4227T2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;4227-2</a> et <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_codes/cdt/r4227_37a41.php?id=R4227T37\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">R.&nbsp;4227-37</a> <small>(applicable le 01/01/27)</small></p>"
      },
      {
        "id": 236,
        "title": "IGH",
        "date": "parution 10 septembre 2025",
        "categories": [
          "igh"
        ],
        "image": "https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/portail/images/index/JO.png",
        "text": "<p align=\"justify\">Arr&ecirc;t&eacute; du 1<sup>er</sup>&nbsp;septembre 2025 modifiant l'arr&ecirc;t&eacute; du 30 d&eacute;cembre 2011 portant r&egrave;glement de s&eacute;curit&eacute; pour la construction des immeubles de grande hauteur et leur protection contre les risques d'incendie et de panique</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">Articles modifi&eacute;s&nbsp;: \r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_igh/igh/gh01a05.php?id=GH5\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">GH&nbsp;5</a>, \r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_igh/igh/gh35a39.php?id=GH36\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">GH&nbsp;36</a> et \r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_igh/igh/gh35a39.php?id=GH37\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">GH&nbsp;37</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"justify\">Cet arr&ecirc;t&eacute; est applicable &agrave; compter du 1<sup>er</sup>&nbsp;janvier 2026.</p>"
      },
      {
        "id": 208,
        "title": "Renouvellement des CCDSA",
        "date": "Parution du 17 mai 2025",
        "categories": [
          "erp",
          "igh"
        ],
        "image": "https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/portail/images/index/JO.png",
        "text": "<p align=\"justify\">D&eacute;cret n&deg;&nbsp;2025-429 du 15 mai 2025<br>\r\nLes commissions consultatives d&eacute;partementales de s&eacute;curit&eacute; et d'accessibilit&eacute;, pr&eacute;vues par le d&eacute;cret du 8&nbsp;mars 1995, sont prorog&eacute;es jusqu'au 8&nbsp;juin 2030</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/loda/id/JORFTEXT000051604221\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">Voir le texte</a></p>"
      },
      {
        "id": 186,
        "title": "Résistance au feu des produits de construction",
        "date": "Parution au Journal officiel de l&rsquo;Union européenne le 13 juin 2024",
        "categories": [
          "erp",
          "igh",
          "hab",
          "ert"
        ],
        "image": null,
        "text": "<p align=\"justify\">R&egrave;glement d&eacute;l&eacute;gu&eacute; (UE) 2024/1681 de la Commission du 6&nbsp;mars 2024 compl&eacute;tant le r&egrave;glement (UE) n&deg;&nbsp;305/2011 du Parlement europ&eacute;en et du Conseil en &eacute;tablissant des classes de performance relatives &agrave; la r&eacute;sistance au feu des produits de construction</p>\r\n<p align=\"justify\">Applicable le 3&nbsp;juillet 2024.</p>\r\n<p align=\"justify\">Ce r&egrave;glement abroge la d&eacute;cision 2000/367/CE.</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\">Article concern&eacute;&nbsp;: <a href=\"https://sitesecurite.com/contenu/_txt/txt_const/a04_03_22.php\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"linknews\">Arr&ecirc;t&eacute; du 22&nbsp;mars 2004 modifi&eacute; (Annexe&nbsp;1-1&nbsp;: Syst&egrave;me adopt&eacute; au niveau communautaire)</a></p>"
      },
      {
        "id": 184,
        "title": "Comportement au feu des câbles électriques",
